type: software
title: "Enterprise ML Platform"
abstract: "Enterprise ML Platform is a production-oriented Python framework for building, operating, and monitoring machine learning systems in enterprise environments. The repository provides end-to-end MLOps components for multi-source data ingestion, feature engineering, distributed model training, model registry workflows, deployment automation, observability, drift detection, alerting, and data quality management. It includes API services, command-line tooling, tests, Docker and Kubernetes assets, Terraform infrastructure templates, monitoring dashboards, and example pipelines for domains such as fraud detection, natural language processing, computer vision, and time series forecasting."
